<% resort, inches = @alerts.first %>
POWDER ALERT: <%= resort.name %> is forecast <%= inches.round(1) %>" in the next 3 days.
Snow report: https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>
<% if @alerts.size > 1 %>
Also getting snow:
<% @alerts.drop(1).each do |r, amount| %>- <%= r.name %> (<%= r.state_province %>): <%= amount.round(1) %>"
<% end %><% end %>
Unsubscribe: <%= @unsubscribe_url %>
